WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.415
Apollo Q Labs. Level two: Strategies.

2
00:00:04.715 --> 00:00:14.209
The nine presets, ready-made strategy templates, from single legs, one-option trades, to spreads and volatility trades, bets on how big a move is.

3
00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:27.224
Module one: Long calls and long puts. The simplest directional trades, bets on up or down, and their break-evens, the stock prices at expiration where profit or loss is zero.

4
00:00:27.224 --> 00:00:35.183
Module two: Covered calls and cash-secured puts. Income-style trades that sell an option against shares or cash you hold.

5
00:00:35.183 --> 00:00:45.275
Module three: Vertical spreads, buying one option and selling another. Bull call and bear put spreads, with risk and reward capped and known up front.

6
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:52.103
Module four: Iron condors, straddles and strangles. Trades about how much the stock moves, not which way.

7
00:00:52.403 --> 00:00:54.303
Start with module one.
